# Part 9b: fork, exec and spawn in a process with threads (ADR-0306), through
# the broker, from dash, in the POSIX session.
! -FAIL
! panicked
! ZORAYA-PANIC
! ZORAYA-FAULT
< PSURF> 
> t_posix tfork\r
< t_posix: tfork passed
< PSURF> 
> t_posix tforkthread\r
< t_posix: tforkthread passed
< PSURF> 
> t_posix texec\r
< t_posix: texec passed
< PSURF> 
> t_posix tspawn\r
< t_posix: tspawn passed
< PSURF> 
> t_posix tsig\r
< t_posix: tsig passed
< PSURF> 
> t_posix tsigdfl\r
< t_posix: tsigdfl passed
< PSURF> 
> t_posix treroute\r
< t_posix: treroute passed
< PSURF> 
> t_posix twait\r
< t_posix: twait passed
< PSURF> 
> exit\r
< BROKER-STATS
